# Domain logic

Scheduling, scoring, and session rules live in `lib/` as plain functions. No `'use server'`, no React, no Prisma.

Pass `now: Date` in. Do not call `new Date()` inside these functions. Colocate tests as `*.test.ts` next to the module and pin the instant in the test.

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
export function nextDue() {
  return addDays(new Date(), 1);
}

// ✅ GOOD
export function nextDue(now: Date): Date {
  return addDays(now, 1);
}
```
